<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Inventories are stated net of inventory reserves of approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c632" contextRef="i_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:InventoryValuationReserves" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">4.6</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction id="c633" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:InventoryValuationReserves" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">4.8</ix:nonFraction> million, as of June 30, 2026, and December 31, 2025, respectively.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

