<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Revenue from the Company&#8217;s sole significant customer, Johnson &amp; Johnson MedTech (&#8220;J&amp;J MedTech&#8221;), part of the Johnson &amp; Johnson Medical Companies, as a percentage of the Company&#8217;s total revenue was <ix:nonFraction id="c761" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="Pure" name="anik:RevenuesFromAgreementsAsPercentOfTotalRevenue" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">53</ix:nonFraction>%<b> </b>and <ix:nonFraction id="c762" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30" unitRef="Pure" name="anik:RevenuesFromAgreementsAsPercentOfTotalRevenue" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="1">50</ix:nonFraction>% for the three-months ended June 30, 2026, and 2025, respectively, and <ix:nonFraction id="c763" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="Pure" name="anik:RevenuesFromAgreementsAsPercentOfTotalRevenue" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="1"><ix:nonFraction id="c764" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30" unitRef="Pure" name="anik:RevenuesFromAgreementsAsPercentOfTotalRevenue" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="1">50</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>% for the six-months ended June 30, 2026, and 2025.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

