			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>MANAGEMENT</b>&#8217;<b>S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND RESULTS OF OPERATIONS<a id="itm2" href="#"></a></b></p>
