<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b>Rule 10b5-1 Trading Plans</b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">During the fiscal quarter ended June 30, 2026, <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c1271"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c1272"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c1273"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c1274">none</span></span></span></span> of the our directors or executive officers adopted or terminated any contract, instruction or written plan for the purchase or sale of our securities that was intended to satisfy the affirmative defense conditions of Rule 10b5-1(c) or any &#8220;non-Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement.&#8221;</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

